{"id": 19, "ok": true, "cmd": "gates", "ucas": "gates isqrt(x: u4)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gates", "basis": "c", "input_bits": 4, "output_bits": 4, "constant_bits": 2, "minimal": true, "cost": 5, "steps": 5, "candidates": 660213, "program": [{"dst": "t0", "gate": "or", "args": ["x0", "x1"], "expr": "x0 | x1"}, {"dst": "t1", "gate": "or", "args": ["x2", "x3"], "expr": "x2 | x3"}, {"dst": "t2", "gate": "or", "args": ["x2", "t0"], "expr": "x2 | t0"}, {"dst": "t3", "gate": "xor", "args": ["x3", "t1"], "expr": "x3 xor t1"}, {"dst": "t4", "gate": "xor", "args": ["t2", "t3"], "expr": "t2 xor t3"}], "outputs": {"r3": "0", "r2": "0", "r1": "t1", "r0": "t4"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "truth_table", "points": 16, "passed": true, "text": "every output bit on every care input"}], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "iterative deepening on cost: no program of a lower cost exists"}, "files": [], "text": "gates for isqrt(x): 4 input bits -> 4 output bits (2 constant), basis c\n  minimal: cost 5, 5 steps (no program of cost <= 4 exists; 660213 candidates searched)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs\n  t0 = or(x0, x1)                = x0 | x1\n  t1 = or(x2, x3)                = x2 | x3\n  t2 = or(x2, t0)                = x2 | t0\n  t3 = xor(x3, t1)               = x3 xor t1\n  t4 = xor(t2, t3)               = t2 xor t3\n  r3 = 0\n  r2 = 0\n  r1 = t1\n  r0 = t4\n"}
{"id": 20, "ok": true, "cmd": "gates", "ucas": "gates isqrt(x: u4) basis a64sha as c", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gates", "basis": "a64sha", "input_bits": 4, "output_bits": 4, "constant_bits": 2, "minimal": true, "cost": 3, "steps": 3, "candidates": 4576, "program": [{"dst": "t0", "gate": "or", "args": ["x0", "x1"], "expr": "x0 | x1"}, {"dst": "t1", "gate": "or", "args": ["x2", "x3"], "expr": "x2 | x3"}, {"dst": "t2", "gate": "bsl", "args": ["x2", "x3", "t0"], "expr": "x2 & x3 | ~x2 & t0"}], "outputs": {"r3": "0", "r2": "0", "r1": "t1", "r0": "t2"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "truth_table", "points": 16, "passed": true, "text": "every output bit on every care input"}], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "iterative deepening on cost: no program of a lower cost exists"}, "files": [], "text": "gates for isqrt(x): 4 input bits -> 4 output bits (2 constant), basis a64sha\n  minimal: cost 3, 3 steps (no program of cost <= 2 exists; 4576 candidates searched)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs\n  t0 = or(x0, x1)                = x0 | x1\n  t1 = or(x2, x3)                = x2 | x3\n  t2 = bsl(x2, x3, t0)           = x2 & x3 | ~x2 & t0\n  r3 = 0\n  r2 = 0\n  r1 = t1\n  r0 = t2\n\n/* _, basis a64sha: bits are independent lanes, so the same code also\n   runs bit-sliced on whole words */\nstatic inline uint32_t\nf_gates(uint32_t x)\n{\n\tuint32_t x0 = x >> 0 & 1;\n\tuint32_t x1 = x >> 1 & 1;\n\tuint32_t x2 = x >> 2 & 1;\n\tuint32_t x3 = x >> 3 & 1;\n\tuint32_t t0 = x0 | x1;\n\tuint32_t t1 = x2 | x3;\n\tuint32_t t2 = x2 & x3 | ~x2 & t0;\n\treturn (t2 & 1) << 0 | (t1 & 1) << 1;\n}\n"}
