der gt1030 (sampled floats); defined as ap1..:\n  measured on 131102 f32 in [-1.57079637, 1.57079637]; ulp against the exact value (naive rounding in parentheses)\n  #   kind      deg   form        error (naive)            max rel       max abs       cost\n  1   minimax   5     horner+fma  1.82e+03 ulp             0.000122      0.000108      4    at x=-1.16394172e-10\n      x*P(x^2): x*fma(fma(0.00760290353, s, -0.165960118), s, 0.999891818) where s = x*x\n  2   minimax   7     horner+fma  17.1 ulp (17.1)          1.86e-06      1.02e-06      5    at x=-1.5704608\n      x*P(x^2): x*fma(fma(fma(-0.000184881399, s, 0.00831189938), s, -0.16665554), s, 0.999999046) where s = x*x\n  1 more: 'approx more [n]' (dominated or worse)\n"}
